<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>AI Chat Assistant</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/marked/marked.min.js"></script>
</head>
<body>

    <header class="app-header">
        <div class="header-left">
            <div class="logo-icon">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-robot"></i>
            </div>
            <div class="brand-info">
                <h1>AI Chat Assistant</h1>
                <p class="status-online"><span class="dot"></span> OpenAI GPT Connected</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="header-right">
            <input type="password" id="apiKeyInput" value="••••••••••••••••" disabled>
            <button id="clearChatBtn" onclick="clearChat()" title="Hapus Semua Chat">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-trash-can"></i>
            </button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main id="chatBox" class="chat-container">
        <div class="message-wrapper assistant">
            <div class="avatar"><i class="fa-solid fa-robot"></i></div>
            <div class="message-bubble">
                <p>Halo! Sesuai request kamu, kodingan ini sudah full dipasang API Key OpenAI milikmu secara otomatis.</p>
                <p>Silakan ketik pertanyaan atau perintah apa saja di kolom bawah, lalu tekan Enter! 😊</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <div id="typingIndicator" class="typing-indicator hidden">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-notch animate-spin"></i> AI sedang berpikir...
    </div>

    <footer class="app-footer">
        <div class="input-wrapper">
            <textarea id="userInput" rows="1" placeholder="Ketik pesan di sini... (Tekan Enter untuk kirim)" onkeydown="handleKeyPress(event)"></textarea>
            <button id="sendBtn" onclick="sendMessage()">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i>
            </button>
        </div>
    </footer>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
